      "name": "EnumerateDirectDrawDevices",
      "signature": "undefined4 EnumerateDirectDrawDevices(HINSTANCE hInstance)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Enumerates DirectDraw devices to detect boards supporting DirectX.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up SEH exception handling frame\n2. Check fog state for DirectX 3 restriction condition\n3. Log detection status messages\n4. Create temporary enumeration window (640x480, WS_POPUP | WS_VISIBLE)\n5. Call DirectDrawEnumerateA with TestDirectDrawDeviceCapabilities callback\n6. Clean up enumeration window\n7. Return success if any valid devices found\n\nParameters:\n  hInstance - Application instance handle for window creation (IMPLICIT: ECX)\n\nReturns:\n  1 (TRUE) - At least one valid DirectDraw device found\n  0 (FALSE) - No valid devices found or window creation failed\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  DWORD_00418f58 - DirectX 3 restriction flag\n  DWORD_00418f64 - Enumeration window handle\n  DWORD_00418f6c - Valid device count\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x40000 - WS_EX_APPWINDOW (extended window style)\n  0xA0000000 - WS_POPUP | WS_VISIBLE (window style)\n  0x280 (640) - Window width\n  0x1E0 (480) - Window height\n  3 - DirectX version check value",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:fa30b389477e74331acd1559bb0637fa",
