      "name": "SkipBindingStateIterations",
      "signature": "byte SkipBindingStateIterations(int * pBindingCount, byte * pbBindingBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "byte",
      "comment": "Skip binding iterations until non-active binding state found.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load counter address from [ESP+8]\n2. Load buffer pointer from [ESP+10]\n3. Loop: Increment counter, read byte from buffer\n4. Check if binding state is active via IsBindingStateFlagSet\n5. Continue loop while binding state is active (dVar1 != 0)\n6. Return byte value when binding state is inactive\n\nParameters:\n  pBindingCount (int *) - Pointer to iteration counter, incremented each loop\n  pbBindingBuffer (byte *) - Pointer to binding buffer, reads bytes sequentially\n\nReturns:\n  Byte value (in EAX) - Last byte read when binding state became inactive\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Infinite loop if binding state never clears\n  - Buffer overrun if pbBindingBuffer not properly terminated",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
