      "name": "IsCppException",
      "signature": "bool IsCppException(int * pExceptionInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Validates whether an exception is a Microsoft Visual C++ exception.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dereference pExceptionInfo to get the EXCEPTION_RECORD pointer\n2. Check if ExceptionCode equals 0xE06D7363 (MSVC++ exception signature)\n3. Verify NumberParameters equals 3 (standard C++ exception parameter count)\n4. Confirm magic signature 0x19930520 at offset 0x14 (MSVC date marker)\n5. Ensure exception object pointer at offset 0x1C is NULL\n6. Return TRUE if all checks pass, FALSE otherwise\n\nParameters:\n  pExceptionInfo - Pointer to EXCEPTION_POINTERS structure from SEH handler\n\nReturns:\n  TRUE (1) if this is a valid C++ exception\n  FALSE (0) if not a C++ exception or validation fails\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xE06D7363 - MSVC++ exception code ('msc' + 0xE0000000)\n  0x19930520 - Visual C++ signature date (May 20, 1993)\n  3 - Expected number of exception parameters for C++ exceptions\n\nStructure Layout (EXCEPTION_RECORD offsets):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x00    4     ExceptionCode      Must be 0xE06D7363\n  0x10    4     NumberParameters   Must be 3\n  0x14    4     MagicNumber        Must be 0x19930520\n  0x1C    4     ExceptionObject    Must be NULL",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
