      "name": "ExecuteInventoryCallback",
      "signature": "dword ExecuteInventoryCallback(dword nCallbackId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Execute registered callback handler for storage inventory by callback ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate callback ID against known types (0x2, 0x4, 0x8, 0xb, 0xf, 0x15, 0x16)\n2. Route to appropriate callback pointer: g_pInventoryCallback, g_pEquipmentCallback, g_pStashCallback, g_pCubeCallback\n3. For TLS context callbacks (0x4, 0x8, 0xb): retrieve context via GetOrCreateTlsContext(), resolve callback from context\n4. For specific callback IDs requiring lock: acquire critical section lock (ID=0x2, 0xf, 0x15, 0x16)\n5. Check if callback is null (return 0) or invalid marker g_InvalidTooltipMarker (return 0)\n6. If callback is null and no lock held: exit with status 0x3\n7. For slot clearing (ID=0x8): iterate inventory slots, clear data, restore flags after callback\n8. Execute callback with ID parameter or slot count parameter\n9. Restore inventory state if was modified\n10. Release critical section lock if acquired\n\nParameters:\nnCallbackId (dword): Storage callback type ID (0x2, 0x4, 0x8, 0xb, 0xf, 0x15, 0x16)\n\nReturns:\n0xFFFFFFFF: Invalid callback ID\n0: Success (callback was valid null/invalid marker or executed)\n0x3: Fatal error (null callback without lock)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nID 0x8: Inventory slot clearing special case - saves/restores equipment and item type fields\nIDs 0x4, 0xb: Equipment/cubes also require field preservation\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x2: Primary inventory callback\n0x4: Equipped items\n0x8: Inventory with slot clearing\n0xb: Cube storage  \n0xf: Stash storage\n0x15: Equipment alternate\n0x16: Another alternate\n0x8c: Slot clear marker\n0xc: Slot data stride (3 dwords per slot)\n0x50: TLS context offset to slot array base\n0x54, 0x58: Equipment/item type save fields",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:1cf273a2136b037dabf3c7ff67d75441100a1069bc66e28862847443e8c70016",
