      "name": "InitDefaultLanguageId",
      "signature": "void InitDefaultLanguageId(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the active language ID from the default language setting.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read default language ID from g_wDefaultLanguageId (0x004139f8)\n2. Store to active language ID at g_wActiveLanguageId (0x00418fac)\n\nParameters:\nvoid - No parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_wActiveLanguageId (0x00418fac): Set to default language ID value\n\nPurpose:\nResets the active locale/language setting used by FindResourceExA\nfor loading localized resources. Called during initialization or\nwhen resetting language settings to default.\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_00406230: Sets language ID from display mode table (index-based)\n- FUN_004062b0: Uses g_wActiveLanguageId with FindResourceExA",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
