      "signature": "LPVOID LoadLocalizedResourceA(HMODULE hModule, LPCSTR lpszType, LPCSTR lpszName)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "LPVOID",
      "comment": "Loads and locks a localized Windows resource with language fallback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Attempt to find resource using active language ID (g_wActiveLanguageId)\n2. If not found, retry with neutral language ID (0)\n3. If resource handle obtained, load the resource into memory\n4. Lock the resource to get a pointer to the data\n5. Return the locked resource pointer (or NULL on failure)\n\nParameters:\n  hModule  - HMODULE: Handle to module containing the resource\n  lpszType - LPCSTR: Resource type identifier (e.g., RT_STRING, RT_DIALOG)\n  lpszName - LPCSTR: Resource name or integer identifier (MAKEINTRESOURCE)\n\nReturns:\n  LPVOID - Pointer to locked resource data on success\n  NULL   - If resource not found or load/lock failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Falls back to neutral language (0) if localized version unavailable\n  - Returns NULL at any failure point without error logging\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - ShowLocalizedDialogBox (caller)\n  - LoadLocalizedStringA (caller)\n\nWindows API Sequence:\n  FindResourceExA -> LoadResource -> LockResource",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04c",
