      "name": "CreateLocalizedDialog",
      "signature": "void * CreateLocalizedDialog(void * hInstance, char * lpszTemplateName, void * hWndParent, void * lpDialogFunc)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Creates a modeless dialog box with localization support.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Attempt to load localized dialog template via LoadLocalizedResourceA using RT_DIALOG (5)\n2. If localized template found, create dialog using CreateDialogIndirectParamA with the template\n3. If no localized template available, fall back to CreateDialogParamA with resource name\n\nParameters:\n  hInstance (ECX): Module instance handle containing the dialog resource\n  lpszTemplateName (EDX): Name or ordinal of the dialog box template resource\n  hWndParent (Stack+0x4): Parent window handle for the dialog\n  lpDialogFunc (Stack+0x8): Pointer to dialog procedure callback function\n\nReturns:\n  HWND: Handle to the created dialog window, or NULL on failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Falls back to non-localized dialog if LoadLocalizedResourceA returns NULL\n  - Always passes 0 as dwInitParam to dialog creation functions\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x5 - RT_DIALOG resource type identifier",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04c",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:23e30e3d4ecf10b36117deb334fcde1e3d95551710cfbaeb2dfc198fece05496",
