      "name": "CountValidatedLockContextEntities",
      "signature": "undefined CountValidatedLockContextEntities(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Wrapper that invokes ProcessLockContextEntities in Count Mode to count validated entities\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ProcessLockContextEntities with mode parameter set to 1 (Count Mode)\n2. Return result containing count of successfully validated lock context entities\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid (return value from ProcessLockContextEntities discarded by caller convention)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Decompiler shows void return but callee returns int; actual return in EAX may be used\n- Mode 1 counts entities with active flags (0x83) that pass ValidateAndProcessEntity()\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ProcessLockContextEntities: Main processing function called with mode=1\n- ValidateAndProcessEntity: Called by ProcessLockContextEntities for each entity",
